HB0053 Governmental claims-negligent investigations.
Sponsored By: Joint Judiciary Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to governmental claims; specifying that governmental entities
are not liable for damages to criminal suspects for the negligent investigations
of peace officers acting within the scope of their official duties; providing
legislative intent; specifying applicability; and providing for an effective
date.
